/-!
Auditor's supplement to the Lean archive of "Tight Bounds for Tusnády's Problem in the Plane"
(not part of the audited archive). Manuscript: `tusnady-plane-stoc27-vC-r65`.

The supplement formalizes the proof of the manuscript as it is written: the numbered
statements, the displays (1)–(18), the definitions of Sections 1–2 and of the appendix, and
the steps of the proofs are stated in the manuscript's own terms, and Theorem 1.1 is derived
from them. `audit-claude/Gates.lean` lists the statements in the order of the manuscript;
`audit-claude/AUDIT_CLAUDE.md` records how each one compares with the manuscript.

